    "plain": "An official ombudsman found the government mishandled communications with these women, and compensating them would uphold due process and the rule of law. The main caveat is that the government has so far rejected the recommendation, and a judicial review is still live.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether the ongoing judicial review process will compel a compensation scheme, and on what terms \u2014 which determines whether this policy's stated remedy ever becomes real.",
    "claims": [
